{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When night falls, the fate of the kingdom lies in your hands. <br>In <strong>Dawn Watcher</strong>, you take the role of the Hero King, commanding your army to resist invading forces and creatures that rise in the darkness. <br>A war of <strong>unit counters, tactical deployment, and survival</strong> begins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>26 Unique Units</strong>: Each with special skills and counter mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero Combat System</strong>: Unleash powerful skills, face enemy bosses, and ultimately battle a rival King equal to yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 Maps \u00b7 49 Levels</strong>: Unlock units, gather resources, and confront enemy commanders in large-scale wars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day &amp; Night Cycle</strong>: Daytime battles against armies, nighttime raids from monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Deployment &amp; Formations</strong>: Buy, summon, and arrange troops with strategic counters and skill combos.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign Mode</strong>: A full story campaign with progressive challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Mode</strong> (Planned): Configure units and enemy waves freely.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3631480?t=1756963240","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631480/4440d90195d01072d72a43ac43979fc3947a143e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756963240","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631480/a200a9aaa15ebd08ced9eb49e5f6f9f51aa22d82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756963240","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse